Numbers in the goldens of the @scans family, each allowed by a named entry with its reason
(gh-ocannl-1056). The goldens read and every refused number go to stderr.

every golden the scans family diffs is a checked-in file this scan read: true
no golden of the scans family carries a number the allow-list does not name: true
every allow-list entry still allows a number in its golden: true
every allow-list entry gives its reason in words: true

Synthetic controls:
a census total on a synthetic golden line is refused: true
a number the whole of one match spans is allowed: true
a match spanning only part of a number does not allow it: true
a total sharing its line with an allowed citation is still refused: true
an entry for another golden does not reach this one: true
a total followed by its unit is still a number: true
a digit run continuing a name is not a number: true
a single digit is outside the boundary: true
an entry that allows nothing is stale: true
the family is a test's golden, a rule's diff, one behind a member's own deps, and a subdir's: true
a test outside the family, or with no golden checked in, contributes nothing: true

